      "content": "thanks. can u make it a bit more detailed though? like maybe mention the actual arguments people are using? some people are saying it's a massive violation of parental rights and bodily autonomy, while others say it's just basic science to keep schools open and safe. can u frame it so it shows why the mandate is being considered as a necessity? like maybe explain the science part better so people understand why it's being pushed.",
