      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get that, but i feel like the \"parental rights\" part sounds a bit too much like an equal argument when really most of the doctors and health experts are saying the science is settled and that the concerns about autonomy are basically just being used to spread misinformation. can you rewrite it so it's more clear that the mandate is the scientifically sound option and that the opposition is largely based on unfounded fears or misinformation? i want the newsletter to help people understand why the mandate is actually the rational choice here.",
